python3 3.11.12 -- WORK IN PROGRESS

This port is in active development and is NOT yet shipped.
The binary builds but has unresolved runtime issues. There is
no LHA package yet. This readme exists only to satisfy the
port-hygiene checks until the port is ready for release.

See ports/python3/PORT.md for the current status and known
issues.

Built on: amiport posix-shim
Cross-compiled with m68k-amigaos-gcc 6.5.0b for AmigaOS 3.x.
